      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON LORENZ (5) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 4 length third over 460m this track in 25.83. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Key chance in this line up. GODZILLA (1) looks close to another win after finishing third last time (30.06) in a Mix 6/7 at Sandown. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Hard to beat again. PERFECT SYMPHONY (2) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fourth (30.17) at Sandown. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from three starts. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Expected to give a good account. TOSS IT UP (8) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can atone.",
